{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":67732,\"title\":\"Woodsmith Shop\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"The Woodsmith Shop is designed to help you get the most out of your woodworking shop with helpful tips and techniques. Whether viewers are just starting out or have been woodworking for years, they'll find something new in every episode.\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/A2cT0MxCHTIBrZIve5hZj0nAizF.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":null,\"youtubeBackdrop\":\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/6VBSZbZ61Og/maxresdefault.jpg\",\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":5.5,\"voteCount\":2,\"year\":2007,\"genres\":[\"Reality\"],\"status\":\"Returning Series\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":19,\"totalEpisodes\":221,\"createdBy\":[\"Don Peschke\"],\"networks\":[],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"2023-10-27\",\"cast\":[],\"trailers\":[{\"key\":\"6VBSZbZ61Og\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"8tFdZy83yI0\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"yE_dUduhGM8\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":97655,\"title\":\"Classic Woodworking\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/goGYVomZXjqTJDLyRjLQ5TtxTEd.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.43529411764705883,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":61779,\"title\":\"Framework\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bd9kcH7xIdEH9q7SnD0bO2D8kBC.jpg\",\"rating\":4.7,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4227848101265823,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":2351,\"title\":\"TransGeneration\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cckeDldsr3JCFTp5hmyNRs5eLVX.jpg\",\"rating\":6.1,\"year\":2005,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4206896551724138,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":327624,\"title\":\"The Reclaimers: Made in Suffolk\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nJAAREOpLJtULyDAPf5ngWd8y58.jpg\",\"rating\":5.5,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.42000000000000004,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":217695,\"title\":\"The Woodland Workshop\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eAJbnzDN6zemQ9fxLX26MRkiJvs.jpg\",\"rating\":2,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.4076923076923077,\"_genreOverlap\":1}],\"seasonNumber\":16,\"seasonName\":\"Season 16\",\"seasonOverview\":\"\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jhpPHXpyxOjW4tLjjWuITYp49Vp.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2022-09-17\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"Arts & Crafts Sideboard pt. 1\",\"overview\":\"Follow along with this classic design. Built with solid, mortise and tenon construction, distinctive Craftsman details, and in a perfect size for your home.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yXvS5LxDu56t7xsIMRFcLK7pBXD.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-09-17\",\"runtime\":26},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"Arts & Crafts Sideboard pt. 2\",\"overview\":\"Dovetailed drawers, a solid wood top, and a rich finish round out the work on completing this heirloom treasure for your home.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xllANlyDdjAN0zChANjZqmJrCA4.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-09-24\",\"runtime\":26},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"3 Shop-Made Tools\",\"overview\":\"Each cast member constructs a hand tool that not only works hard, but also teaches some valuable woodworking lessons along the way.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/c1VNmRUtiBqsX4NVgCiuz6hZ9dR.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-10-01\",\"runtime\":26},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Game On – Chessboard\",\"overview\":\"It’s your move with this fun gameboard. Stow the pieces with some built-in storage. Then learn how to make a set of distinctive pieces to play with.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lBV941Rmt9bSIO1Pqhz140KViKP.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-10-08\",\"runtime\":26},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Have A Seat – Building a Stick Chair\",\"overview\":\"This chair takes its design cues from Welsh country chairs. The cast shows the steps and the hand tools to make one for yourself. The design lets you customize the look to your style.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sRELeyDgECF6hNmqe2IL02hq7KM.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-10-15\",\"runtime\":26},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Built-Ins With Brent Hull\",\"overview\":\"Built-in projects add value and style to your home. Learn about design details that help you get the look right. Then learn simple ideas for getting the best result.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/s4jP1qITZr6ZAuyXDeeQ1gqXcmg.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-10-22\",\"runtime\":26},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Two Clever Router Jigs\",\"overview\":\"These two projects help you unlock the capabilities of your router. Tackle essential joinery details. Also, use your router to create crisp, accurate miters.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eiL1SvJ2SH2Mw1fUZJkHxJjSHZf.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-10-29\",\"runtime\":26},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"The Ultimate Bookcase pt.1\",\"overview\":\"A bookcase can be so much more than storage. This bookcase goes to the next level with Greene & Greene details. This episode focuses on building the case.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kvKVLRbdZpXKM3Xd6rETFwk7Bc5.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-11-05\",\"runtime\":26},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"The Ultimate Bookcase pt. 2\",\"overview\":\"In the second of this two-part series, the team dives into the glass-paned doors and drawers that featured exposed joinery. The result is a storage piece with style.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xMHosqQStoDtmKXzEZFNlgaNWw0.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-11-12\",\"runtime\":26},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"Stylish Storage Wall Cabinet\",\"overview\":\"Originally designed as a tool cabinet, you’re sure to find a home for this handsome cabinet. The project helps you master essential woodworking skills you can apply to other furniture.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iGTQ7oyamj6VZYJEuONXeDH8hRy.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-11-19\",\"runtime\":26},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"Outdoor Entertaining – Patio Table\",\"overview\":\"Upgrade your deck or patio with this great-looking table. Find out how to build a project that stands up to the elements. Then fire up the grill and get the party started.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/etG75fomztbBOAMhZaLllJhMYKi.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-11-26\",\"runtime\":26},{\"number\":12,\"name\":\"Time for Clocks\",\"overview\":\"Building a clock offers great lessons for learning woodworking on a small scale. The team creates three designs so you’re sure to find one you like.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8zDoPXo21JwiIgsOpIG6qOQeDKL.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-12-03\",\"runtime\":26},{\"number\":13,\"name\":\"Top-Notch Tips\",\"overview\":\"Shop secrets, tips, hacks … whatever you call them. The cast shares the clever lessons that can help you use your tools more effectively, build projects more with more confidence, and organize your workshop better. Find out how to improve your skills on this episode.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/g2A5fmLbwlXHHSKd5LeVEHlEkpO.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-12-10\",\"runtime\":26}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2007-10-05\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}